Source: bande-os
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: bande-os
Architecture: all
Depends: bande-desktop (= ${binary:Version}),
         bande-greeter (= ${binary:Version}),
         greetd,
         network-manager,
         pipewire,
         wireplumber,
         systemd-zram-generator,
         ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: bande-apt-source
Description: Bande operating system
 Turns a Debian testing installation into Bande: the Bande desktop with
 its login window under greetd as the display manager, NetworkManager,
 PipeWire with WirePlumber, compressed swap in memory, and the Bande APT
 repository, through which the system follows every Bande release.
 .
 The Bande desktop does not need this package and installs on any Debian
 testing system on its own.
